### Get User details (lis-fake-service: POST the account to /krds/api/v2/user-accounts first, the store is in memory)
GET {{host}}/v1/users/{{subject}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json
x-cdp-request-id: {{$guid}}

> ../Asserts/Should_be_200_OK.js

### Get User details (unknown subject)
GET {{host}}/v1/users/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

> ../Asserts/Should_be_404.js

### Get User details (subject rejected by KRDS)
GET {{host}}/v1/users/not-a-uuid
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

> ../Asserts/Should_be_400_bad_request.js
